  "body": "*Forget the CV, the vendor is ready to meet the market*\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of sought-after Bucklands Beach, moments from both Eastern Beach and Bucklands Beach, this beautifully crafted two-level residence offers far more than comfort - it offers a lifestyle defined by light, space, and the relaxed rhythm of coastal living.\r\n\r\nMornings begin with a gentle sea breeze drifting through the balcony, while evenings invite an easy stroll to the shoreline, where the sound of waves quietly brings the day to a close. This is not simply a location - it is a rare East Auckland lifestyle that families aspire to secure.\r\n\r\nFilled with natural light, the home has been thoughtfully designed for modern family living, balancing functionality with warmth and understated elegance.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n*\t4 well-appointed bedrooms | 2.5 bathrooms \r\n*\tSeparate study downstairs - ideal for working from home or quiet retreat \r\n*\tMaster suite with peaceful sea views and balcony\r\n*\tBeautifully designed two-level near-new home \r\n*\tOpen-plan living, dining, and kitchen flowing seamlessly for effortless entertaining \r\n*\tExcellent indoor-outdoor connection with deck and balcony, natural light throughout \r\n*\tLow-maintenance modern living in a premium coastal location \r\n*\tWalking distance to Eastern Beach and Bucklands Beach \r\n\r\nInside, the interiors feel calm, bright, and inviting. The open-plan living and dining areas create an effortless sense of flow, making everyday living feel relaxed while offering the perfect setting for entertaining family and friends. The design is refined without being overstated - every detail carefully considered to enhance comfort and practicality.\r\n\r\nWhat truly sets this home apart is its balance. Close enough to the coast to embrace the sea breeze and beachside lifestyle, yet positioned within one of East Auckland's most highly regarded school zones, offering long-term value for growing families.\r\n\r\nZoned for some of Auckland's most sought-after schools, including:\r\n*\tBucklands Beach Primary School \r\n*\tBucklands Beach Intermediate \r\n*\tMacleans College \r\n\r\nSurrounded by established homes, beaches, local cafe, and everyday conveniences, this address delivers a lifestyle that is both peaceful and exceptionally connected.\r\n\r\nDon't delay, call Ally 027 343 3828 to book your private viewing tour.",
